{"seq": 253, "t_ms": 27042, "type": "review_note", "data": {"text": "- **Main caveat:** Coverage is only 3.3–22.7% at every site, so the ranking rests on sparse status snapshots. It shows relative saturation, not true demand, and cannot size the 20-point allocation.\n- **Numbers:** All 46 checked numbers traced; none are untraced or unsupported.\n- **Weak spots:** BZ_P_VITTORIA (8.2% coverage) and the watch-list sites (4.4%, 3.3%) are too thinly observed to treat as firm. The \"cluster\" claim comes from site names only."}}
